{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_adr_adr_0152_a_quotation_opened_with_the_project_defines_its_deliverables_and_initial_requirements_adr_0152", "label": "ADR-0152", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0152-a-quotation-opened-with-the-project-defines-its-deliverables-and-initial-requirements.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A Quotation Kind opened with the project (InvoiceRequest's shape) closes the missing first link of the spine quote \u2192 requirements \u2192 deliverables \u2192 completion \u2192 invoice request: AcceptAsync creates one Deliverable and one Requirement per line; amended for change orders (WP 20.10E), a six-state review lifecycle with Rn revisions (v0.23.0), and the global second-person switch (ADR-0161)."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0152_a_quotation_opened_with_the_project_defines_its_deliverables_and_initial_requirements_quotation", "label": "Quotation", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0152-a-quotation-opened-with-the-project-defines-its-deliverables-and-initial-requirements.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Tempest.Core.Quotations \u2014 deliberately not the frozen CustomerQuotation; Reference given or generated, QuoteDate, client defaulted from the project, currency from the pinned rate card, ValidityDays, Terms, Lines, Total computed never stored."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0152_a_quotation_opened_with_the_project_defines_its_deliverables_and_initial_requirements_quotationline", "label": "QuotationLine", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0152-a-quotation-opened-with-the-project-defines-its-deliverables-and-initial-requirements.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Id, Description, Hours/Rate or FixedPrice (Basis), Amount carried not recomputed, DeliverableId/RequirementId filled at Accept \u2014 or immediately for a change order's carried deliverable."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0152_a_quotation_opened_with_the_project_defines_its_deliverables_and_initial_requirements_quotationstatus", "label": "QuotationStatus", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0152-a-quotation-opened-with-the-project-defines-its-deliverables-and-initial-requirements.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Six states since v0.23.0: Draft \u2192 InReview \u2192 Approved \u2192 Sent \u2192 Accepted | Declined, InReview\u2192Draft with a required comment, Approved\u2192Draft on a line change; the original four-state table is kept for the record."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0152_a_quotation_opened_with_the_project_defines_its_deliverables_and_initial_requirements_quotationstatustransitions", "label": "QuotationStatusTransitions", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0152-a-quotation-opened-with-the-project-defines-its-deliverables-and-initial-requirements.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The sole enforcement point; mirrors InvoiceRequestStatusTransitions' table shape, internal for the same reason."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0152_a_quotation_opened_with_the_project_defines_its_deliverables_and_initial_requirements_iquotationservice", "label": "IQuotationService / QuotationService", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0152-a-quotation-opened-with-the-project-defines-its-deliverables-and-initial-requirements.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Decides every act and reports a QuotationRefusal, never an exception; registered in TempestHost.cs beside IInvoicingService (a disclosed deviation from the Work Package's files-you-own list)."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0152_a_quotation_opened_with_the_project_defines_its_deliverables_and_initial_requirements_acceptasync_non_atomic_orchestration", "label": "AcceptAsync Non-Atomic Orchestration", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0152-a-quotation-opened-with-the-project-defines-its-deliverables-and-initial-requirements.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Milestone, then one Deliverable and one Requirement per line, each its own transaction, then one final transaction moves Status to Accepted and records every created id \u2014 so a second Accept is refused; a crash between creates and the final write is a disclosed gap whose retry throws DuplicateRequirementIdentifierException."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0152_a_quotation_opened_with_the_project_defines_its_deliverables_and_initial_requirements_computed_reference_counter", "label": "Reference Counter Computed From the Store", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0152-a-quotation-opened-with-the-project-defines-its-deliverables-and-initial-requirements.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Q-<yyyy>-<nnn> / CO-<yyyy>-<nnn> minted one past the highest suffix already in the store, the same derive-from-the-store discipline as ProjectDirectory.CreateAsync (TD-38); a narrow cross-process race is accepted, not built out."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0152_a_quotation_opened_with_the_project_defines_its_deliverables_and_initial_requirements_change_order", "label": "Change Order", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0152-a-quotation-opened-with-the-project-defines-its-deliverables-and-initial-requirements.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "QuotationKind.ChangeOrder (WP 20.10E, PO finding D18): a line carries an existing live deliverable from AddLineAsync, so SignOffAsync can ask whether a live change order already names an open deliverable \u2014 no new linking mechanism."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0152_a_quotation_opened_with_the_project_defines_its_deliverables_and_initial_requirements_quotationkind", "label": "QuotationKind", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0152-a-quotation-opened-with-the-project-defines-its-deliverables-and-initial-requirements.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0152_a_quotation_opened_with_the_project_defines_its_deliverables_and_initial_requirements_quotationreview", "label": "QuotationReview / QuotationRevision", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0152-a-quotation-opened-with-the-project-defines-its-deliverables-and-initial-requirements.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Each approval issues the next Rn (RevisionLabel printed on export and send, null while Draft/InReview); persisted as one JSON Review value beside Status; legacy quotations map to R1 if already Sent/Accepted/Declined."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0152_a_quotation_opened_with_the_project_defines_its_deliverables_and_initial_requirements_separation_of_duty", "label": "Separation of Duty (ReviewerMustDifferFromAuthor)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0152-a-quotation-opened-with-the-project-defines-its-deliverables-and-initial-requirements.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "ApproveAsync refuses the submitter, the author and line editors since the last approval, plus AuthorUnknown \u2014 EvidenceService.RecordCheckAsync's independent-check rule applied to a quote; since ADR-0161 only with the global switch on, otherwise QuotationRevision.SelfApproved is recorded."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0152_a_quotation_opened_with_the_project_defines_its_deliverables_and_initial_requirements_quote_to_invoice_spine", "label": "Quote \u2192 Requirements \u2192 Deliverables \u2192 Completion \u2192 Invoice Request Spine", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0152-a-quotation-opened-with-the-project-defines-its-deliverables-and-initial-requirements.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The Product Owner's model (comment item 4, 'a huge priority'): a quote opened with the project defines the initial requirement set and the deliverables."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0152_a_quotation_opened_with_the_project_defines_its_deliverables_and_initial_requirements_ideliverableservice_adddeliverableasync", "label": "IDeliverableService.AddDeliverableAsync", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0152-a-quotation-opened-with-the-project-defines-its-deliverables-and-initial-requirements.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Adds a deliverable directly under a default 'Unquoted' milestone so the Deliverables tab needs neither Timeline nor a quotation."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0152_a_quotation_opened_with_the_project_defines_its_deliverables_and_initial_requirements_projectlifecycleservice_signoffasync", "label": "ProjectLifecycleService.SignOffAsync", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0152-a-quotation-opened-with-the-project-defines-its-deliverables-and-initial-requirements.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Refuses WorkStillOpen while a live deliverable, ManualTask or Calculation is open \u2014 unless, for a deliverable only, a live change order's line already carries it."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0152_a_quotation_opened_with_the_project_defines_its_deliverables_and_initial_requirements_projectrequirementregister", "label": "ProjectRequirementRegister", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0152-a-quotation-opened-with-the-project-defines-its-deliverables-and-initial-requirements.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0152_a_quotation_opened_with_the_project_defines_its_deliverables_and_initial_requirements_requirement_association_by_allocation", "label": "Requirement Association by Allocation, Not Parenting", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0152-a-quotation-opened-with-the-project-defines-its-deliverables-and-initial-requirements.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Requirement is a plain DTO over IEngineeringDocumentStore with no IHasParent; linking it AllocatedTo the quotation (already a project member) lets ProjectRequirementRegister find it with no change to IRequirementsService."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0152_a_quotation_opened_with_the_project_defines_its_deliverables_and_initial_requirements_customerquotation_frozen", "label": "CustomerQuotation (Frozen, CommercialIntelligence)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0152-a-quotation-opened-with-the-project-defines-its-deliverables-and-initial-requirements.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0152_a_quotation_opened_with_the_project_defines_its_deliverables_and_initial_requirements_milestone_and_deliverable_built_in_core", "label": "Milestone and Deliverable Built Directly in Core", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0152-a-quotation-opened-with-the-project-defines-its-deliverables-and-initial-requirements.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Through EngineeringObjectFactory<T>, not IProjectMilestoneService, which lives in Tempest.Workspace that Tempest.Core cannot reference (ADR-0023); the Kind strings are repeated as literals because their canonical owner also lives in Workspace."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_adr_adr_0152_a_quotation_opened_with_the_project_defines_its_deliverables_and_initial_requirements_adr_0152", "target": "docs_governance_architecture_adr_register_adr_0150", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0152-a-quotation-opened-with-the-project-defines-its-deliverables-and-initial-requirements.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_adr_0152_a_quotation_opened_with_the_project_defines_its_deliverables_and_initial_requirements_adr_0152", "target": "docs_governance_architecture_adr_register_adr_0145", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0152-a-quotation-opened-with-the-project-defines-its-deliverables-and-initial-requirements.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_adr_0152_a_quotation_opened_with_the_project_defines_its_deliverables_and_initial_requirements_adr_0152", "target": "docs_governance_architecture_adr_register_adr_0134", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0152-a-quotation-opened-with-the-project-defines-its-deliverables-and-initial-requirements.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_adr_0152_a_quotation_opened_with_the_project_defines_its_deliverables_and_initial_requirements_adr_0152", "target": "docs_governance_architecture_adr_register_adr_0130", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0152-a-quotation-opened-with-the-project-defines-its-deliverables-and-initial-requirements.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_adr_0152_a_quotation_opened_with_the_project_defines_its_deliverables_and_initial